    "Question #: 1": {
      "Title": "Exam 70-533 topic 1 question 1 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "HOTSPOT -"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You manage an Azure Service Bus for your company. You plan to enable access to the Azure Service Bus for an application named ContosoLOB."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You need to create a new shared access policy for subscriptions and queues that has the following requirements:"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Receives messages from a queue"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Deadletters a message"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Defers a message for later retrieval"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Enumerates subscriptions"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "\u2711 Gets subscription description"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "In the table below, identify the permission you need to assign to ensure that ContosoLOB is able to accomplish the above requirements. Make only one selection in each column."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Hot Area:"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "src": "https://www.examtopics.com/assets/media/exam-media/02173/0000200006.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {},
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer:"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "src": "https://www.examtopics.com/assets/media/exam-media/02173/0000300001.png"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "For Service Bus, the three permission claims are Send for all send operations, Listen to open up listeners or receive messages, and Manage to observe or manage the state of the Service Bus tenant."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "To receive a message from a queue we need to have Listen access level."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "To numerate subscriptions, we need to have the manage access level."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "References:"
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "http://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/azure/hh403962.aspx"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Explanation": {
